business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"French, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"kdqoDMuvyNedsouc1i33vQ","name":"Araña Taqueria y Cantina","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"VXiNWnWfvgof-hSiQpR7yQ","review_id":"3lMv1K84Jo89pS2KMgEVwQ","date":"2013-03-31T23:14:08","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.931280255317688,"text_excerpt":"So I live pretty close to this place and just never got around to going. I gave them 5 stars bc I believe they deserve more then 4 for their food and atmosphere. It's really cool- an old fire station. The food was fantastic. We got the kale salad with fried oysters. I'd go back and just order that carry out. It may have been one of the best things I've eaten in a very long time. The combination of flavors was like an orgasim in my mouth! I then got the steak- which was also very good. However... we finished with the creme brulee w chickery and beignets. Lets just say I found myself licking the dish afterwards. The service was great. Our waiter literally appeared every time we needed him a..."},{"business_id":"VXiNWnWfvgof-hSiQpR7yQ","review_id":"9KWeplLox3lcaBabXLur4Q","date":"2014-06-29T06:08:54","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9275326132774353,"text_excerpt":"I read some of the negative reviews before going to Dijon for dinner--ignore them. Had a lovely time with excellent food. Started with the kale and fried oyster salad; not only were the oysters plump and juicy but the kale was delicious with a wonderful dressing. Next had the soup special, sweet potato w/bacon--incredible, I could have this every day, to eat or perhaps take a bath in. Creamy sweet potato with bite size bits of bacon that seemed almost sweet like honey-glazed. YUM! Then the Pan Roasted Duck Breast with Bourbon-cherry duck demi, brabant sweet potatoes w/creole cream sauce, ratatouille. Duck was properly moist, prepared perfectly (I told the waiter to do it \"however Chef thi..."},{"business_id":"VXiNWnWfvgof-hSiQpR7yQ","review_id":"foy1PiKieXIvtOcKx-q21g","date":"2013-07-27T20:33:34","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9255470037460327,"text_excerpt":"This is in my top three favorite places for brunch. We've been there several times and each time we come away completely satisfied. Our last brunch was probably the best meal I've had in a while. We started off with their candied smoked crispy bacon, which is always delicious, but 3 slices so if you're sharing make sure you order more than one :). The second appetizer was the fried oyster salad. The oysters were crispy and moist, the kale was friend and perfectly seasoned and the dressing was delicious. Both of us thought is was just amazing and wanted more. Our entrees were the Smoked Pork Eggs Benedict and the Steak and Eggs. Both were just mouth watering. The steak was well seasoned an..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"VXiNWnWfvgof-hSiQpR7yQ","photo_id":"xvYLobuQ89X7ztH42kJqEA","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/xvYLobuQ89X7ztH42kJqEA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9000076055526733},{"business_id":"VXiNWnWfvgof-hSiQpR7yQ","photo_id":"P8MP90vX02HC9yyAk97bFQ","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/P8MP90vX02HC9yyAk97bFQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8547508716583252},{"business_id":"VXiNWnWfvgof-hSiQpR7yQ","photo_id":"1LcXg-1vLwPPuJcIc1SQjA","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/1LcXg-1vLwPPuJcIc1SQjA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.839838445186615},{"business_id":"VXiNWnWfvgof-hSiQpR7yQ","photo_id":"wXUtzD0LWJsU1NT3kjQ97Q","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/wXUtzD0LWJsU1NT3kjQ97Q.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.